  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="546" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Lebensztejn's work in French; Weiner's work in French and English.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="563" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">First volume: Publisher's black paper boards; titles blind-stamped. Second volume: Wire-stitched into blue paper covers; titles printed in silver. Issued together in a clear glass box (35 x 26 x 4 cm.)</subfield>
  </datafield>
